"<Admonition type=\"caution\">\n"
"  There are some limitations of classical feedforward and control flow operations on quantum hardware that might impact your program. For more information, see [Execute dynamic circuits](/guides/execute-dynamic-circuits).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
